### Register a new user (Registrar un nuevo dueño)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "fullName": "Juan Perez",
    "email": "juan.perez@email.com",
    "password": "MiPasswordSeguro123",
    "phone": "3001234567"
}

### Login user (Iniciar sesión)
POST http://localhost:3000/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "juan.perez@email.com",
    "password": "MiPasswordSeguro123",
    "deviceId": "iphone_juan_001"
}

### Prueba 1: Intentar ver mascotas sin Token (Debe fallar)
GET http://localhost:3000/api/pets
Content-Type: application/json
x-device-id: iphone_juan_001

