### Prueba 5: Registrar una Clínica Veterinaria
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clinics/register
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "nombre_clinica": "Veterinaria Huellitas Sanas",
    "email": "contacto@huellitassanas.com",
    "password": "PasswordClinica123",
    "telefono": "6011234567",
    "direccion": "Calle 45 # 10-20, Bogotá",
    "horarios_atencion": "Lunes a Sábado de 8am a 6pm"
}

### Prueba 6: Login de la Clínica
POST http://localhost:3000/api/clinics/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "email": "contacto@huellitassanas.com",
    "password": "PasswordClinica123"
}

### 1. La Clínica sube un producto con precio base de $10.000 COP
POST http://localhost:3000/api/products
Content-Type: application/json
